%% DEPLOYED (state files in build/, written by the deploy scripts):
%%   ② + ⑤ one container-image Lambda "alphaforge-api" (scripts/deploy_api.py): FastAPI + the agents in-process,
%%     public Function URL (auth NONE) — the API verifies every Cognito ID token itself (AF_AUTH_MODE=cognito);
%%     store = DynamoDB table "alphaforge" (profiles · runs · evidence ledger · contacts); AF_DISPATCH=lambda:
%%     an analysis runs in a second, asynchronous invocation of the same Lambda (15 min max, retries 0).
%%   ⑥ S3 curated Parquet + DynamoDB (deploy_data_layer.py) · AgentCore Gateway (MCP) → quant tools Lambda,
%%     always-warm alias (deploy_quant_gateway.py) · Neptune Serverless market graph in a VPC + Yahoo refresh /
%%     loader Lambdas on EventBridge schedules (deploy_graph.py) · Bedrock Knowledge Base on S3 Vectors
